---
/**
 * Chamada final com vídeo de fundo (public/video/cta.mp4), no mesmo padrão do hero:
 * loop emendado, capa instantânea, botão de pausa e camada escura para leitura.
 * O vídeo só baixa quando a seção chega perto da tela (src/scripts/hero-video.ts).
 */
import Button from '../ui/Button.astro';
import { site, whatsappLink } from '@/config/site';

const poster = '/video/cta-poster.webp';
const src = '/video/cta.mp4';
---

<section aria-labelledby="cta-title" class="relative isolate overflow-hidden bg-ink">
  <!-- Vídeo de fundo -->
  <div class="absolute inset-0 -z-10" data-cta-video>
    <video
      class="absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover"
      data-src={src}
      poster={poster}
      muted
      playsinline
      preload="none"
      aria-hidden="true"
      tabindex="-1"
    ></video>
    <video
      class="absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover opacity-0"
      data-src={src}
      muted
      playsinline
      preload="none"
      aria-hidden="true"
      tabindex="-1"
    ></video>
  </div>

  <!-- Camada escura: leitura do texto e emenda com o resto da página -->
  <div
    class="cta-shade pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 -z-10"
    aria-hidden="true"
    data-cta-shade
  ></div>

  <div class="container-site">
    <div class="ruler ruler-snow h-3" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="py-28 sm:py-36 lg:py-44">
      <div class="max-w-3xl" data-reveal>
        <h2 id="cta-title" class="cta-title max-w-[16ch] !text-snow">
          {site.copy.finalCtaTitle}
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-7 max-w-lg text-lg leading-relaxed text-snow/75">{site.copy.finalCtaText}</p>
        <div class="mt-10 flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row sm:items-center">
          <Button
            href={whatsappLink()}
            external
            size="lg"
            arrow
            class="justify-between sm:justify-center"
            data-track-location="cta-final"
          >
            Chamar no WhatsApp
          </Button>
          <Button href="#contato" size="lg" variant="secondary" class="cta-ghost">
            Preencher o formulário
          </Button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <button
    type="button"
    class="absolute right-5 bottom-6 grid h-8 w-8 place-items-center rounded-[4px] border border-snow/25 text-snow/80 transition-colors hover:border-snow/60 hover:text-snow sm:right-8 lg:right-12"
    data-cta-video-toggle
    aria-label="Pausar vídeo de fundo"
  >
    <svg
      data-icon="pause"
      viewBox="0 0 24 24"
      width="14"
      height="14"
      fill="currentColor"
      aria-hidden="true"
    >
      <rect x="6" y="5" width="4" height="14" rx="1"></rect>
      <rect x="14" y="5" width="4" height="14" rx="1"></rect>
    </svg>
    <svg
      data-icon="play"
      viewBox="0 0 24 24"
      width="14"
      height="14"
      fill="currentColor"
      aria-hidden="true"
      class="hidden"
    >
      <path d="M8 5.5v13a1 1 0 0 0 1.5.86l10.4-6.5a1 1 0 0 0 0-1.72L9.5 4.64A1 1 0 0 0 8 5.5Z"></path>
    </svg>
  </button>
</section>

<style>
  .cta-title {
    font-size: clamp(2.3rem, 1.3rem + 4vw, 4.75rem);
    line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
  }
  [data-cta-video] video {
    transition: opacity 1200ms ease;
  }
  /* O topo do vídeo tem a luz da superfície (muito clara): a camada escurece mais em cima
     e à esquerda, onde está o texto, e funde as bordas com o fundo da página. */
  .cta-shade {
    background:
      linear-gradient(90deg, rgb(5 7 13 / 0.72) 0%, rgb(5 7 13 / 0.38) 42%, rgb(5 7 13 / 0) 72%),
      linear-gradient(
        to bottom,
        rgb(5 7 13 / 0.55) 0%,
        rgb(5 7 13 / 0) 22%,
        rgb(5 7 13 / 0) 70%,
        rgb(5 7 13 / 0.85) 100%
      );
  }
  @media (max-width: 767px) {
    .cta-shade {
      background: linear-gradient(
        to bottom,
        rgb(5 7 13 / 0.6) 0%,
        rgb(5 7 13 / 0.45) 35%,
        rgb(5 7 13 / 0.5) 75%,
        rgb(5 7 13 / 0.88) 100%
      );
    }
  }
  .ruler-snow {
    --tick: rgb(242 245 250 / 0.22);
    --tick-strong: rgb(242 245 250 / 0.45);
  }
  .cta-ghost {
    color: #f2f5fa;
    border-color: rgb(242 245 250 / 0.3);
    backdrop-filter: blur(6px);
  }
  .cta-ghost:hover {
    border-color: rgb(242 245 250 / 0.7);
    background: rgb(242 245 250 / 0.06);
  }
</style>
